%% V02 Test Seq 02
%% Concrete DnD reaction: WizardIria uses Shield on hit window.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Attacker as OrcMarauder UI
  actor Defender as WizardIria UI
  participant Transport as WS/REST Handler
  participant Service as ActionExecutionApplicationService
  participant Graph as OperationGraphStage
  participant Targets as TargetResolutionStage
  participant RollPolicy as Manual Roll Policy
  participant Exec as OutcomeExecutionStage
  participant Interrupt as Interrupt/Reaction Broker
  participant Events as Event Publisher

  Note over Attacker,Service: Encounter setup\nOrcMarauder Greataxe attack modifier 5, damage 1d12 plus 3\nWizardIria AC 15, HP 24, reaction available, Shield prepared

  Attacker->>Transport: execute_action(req-2101, action.weapon_attack.greataxe)
  Transport->>Service: execute_action(command)

  Service->>Graph: build and linearize operation graph
  Graph-->>Service: [op-2101-attack]
  Service->>Targets: resolve explicit target snapshot
  Targets-->>Service: snapshot persisted
  Note over Service: Internal trace only: graph and targeting stage lifecycle
  Service->>Exec: roll attack d20 14, total 19 vs AC 15 provisional hit
  Exec-->>Service: provisional hit outcome before reaction window

  Service->>Interrupt: open reaction window (on_hit)
  Interrupt-->>Defender: reaction_prompt for window on_hit

  alt Defender uses Shield
    Defender->>Transport: continue_interrupt(req-2101, reaction spell.shield)
    Transport->>Service: apply reaction operation
    Service->>Exec: Shield sets AC from 15 to 20 for this window
    Service->>Exec: recompute hit: 19 vs AC 20 (miss)
    Exec-->>Service: reaction_resolved, attack damage canceled
    Service->>Events: attack_result miss after reaction shield
  else Defender declines or window expires
    Interrupt-->>Service: no reaction branch
    Service->>RollPolicy: evaluate manual damage roll mode for greataxe damage
    RollPolicy-->>Service: requires_pending_roll
    Service-->>Transport: ActionExecutionOutcome status pending_roll with roll_context formula 1d12 plus 3
    Transport-->>Attacker: pending_roll prompt for damage entry
    Attacker->>Transport: continue_action req-2101 submitted_roll total 11 die_face 8 modifier 3
    Transport->>Service: resume_from_roll req-2101
    Service->>Exec: validate submitted roll bounds and apply damage total 11 slashing
  end

  Service->>Exec: finalize post-reaction damage branch
  Exec-->>Service: final operation outcomes
  Service->>Events: attack_result hit on WizardIria when no reaction
  Service->>Events: actor_damaged WizardIria amount 11 slashing
  Service->>Events: terminal_action_result for req-2101
  Events-->>Attacker: result batch
  Events-->>Defender: visibility-filtered result batch

  Note over Service,Interrupt: Assertions\n1. Shield branch converts hit to miss and does not roll or apply damage\n2. Decline branch emits pending_roll then applies submitted damage 11\n3. Both branches converge to one terminal outcome for req-2101\n4. No duplicate damage application across branches
